1
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,040
Yu-Gi-Oh!

2
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:04,240
My friends are in danger.

3
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:07,480
I gotta find them before
Merrick's rare hunters do.

4
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:10,840
Going somewhere?

5
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:15,672
If you'd like to rescue your friends,
you'll have to make it past us first.

6
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,300
And that's no easy task.

7
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,120
Listen carefully.

8
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:20,840
I will get past!

9
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:26,160
Sorry, but I'm afraid the only way to
get by us is to defeat us in a duel.

10
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:29,717
Yeah, and that means you
have to defeat both of us.

11
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:32,800
Sorry, but we have strict
orders from Master Marek.

12
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:35,640
So, which one of us shall go first?

13
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:37,397
The honor belongs to you.

14
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:40,140
Oh, no, you first. I insist. Fine.

15
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:41,217
Let's draw for it.

16
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:42,620
With our usual game?

17
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:44,330
Yes.

18
00:01:44,413 --> 00:01:45,886
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot.

19
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:47,780
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot.

20
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,270
Shoot.

21
00:01:49,353 --> 00:01:50,580
This always happens.

22
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:53,957
It wouldn't happen if you
played something besides paper.

23
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:56,177
Well, why don't you play something else?

24
00:01:56,260 --> 00:01:57,966
Rock, paper, scissors, shoot.

25
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,414
Rock, paper, scissors.

26
00:01:59,980 --> 00:02:00,810
Rocks?

27
00:02:00,893 --> 00:02:01,723
That's enough!

28
00:02:01,806 --> 00:02:02,636
Time is running out!

29
00:02:02,719 --> 00:02:03,840
Not to worry.

30
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,437
We shall defeat you soon.

31
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:08,717
But as you know, only one of
us may duel you at a time.

32
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:11,560
But not if both of us duel against you.

33
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:13,430
Kaiba!

34
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:15,160
Now it's two on two.

35
00:02:15,460 --> 00:02:16,931
We accept your challenge.

36
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:19,984
We'll win both their
Egyptian god cards at once.

37
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:23,180
You two won't win. You got it?

38
00:02:23,740 --> 00:02:27,157
But it is true that the
losing pair will hand over

39
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:30,299
their rarest cards and
locator cards to the winners.

40
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:35,382
And if you two pathetic fools believe you'll
be taking our Egyptian god cards away,

41
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:38,720
you obviously don't know
who you're dealing with.

42
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:44,240
And as soon as you two are out of
the way, I'm dueling you, Yugi.

43
00:02:44,740 --> 00:02:45,680
We'll see.

44
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:49,300
All right, it's time to
begin this duel already.

45
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:52,797
Yes, so we can receive our
reward from Master Marek,

46
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:57,217
for once we defeat you, he'll have all
three Egyptian god cards. Let's go.

47
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:59,300
It's time to duel.

48
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,000
Who shall begin?

49
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:05,360
We'll let you go first, Kaiba.

50
00:03:06,940 --> 00:03:11,220
Conquering you two chumps won't
take very long at all. Trust me.

51
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:15,740
I play the magic card, Pot of Greed.

52
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:18,700
It allows me to draw
two cards from my deck.

53
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:22,880
And next, I'll summon a monster
known as the Lord of Dragons.

54
00:03:26,820 --> 00:03:31,120
Now, I'll add not one, but two
flutes of summoning dragon.

55
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:35,113
But what's the point of all this anyway?

56
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:41,040
Yeah, any amateur knows that one flute can
summon two dragons to the dueling field.

57
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:44,660
So since I have two flutes,
I can summon four dragons.

58
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:47,320
Four in one turn? That's right.

59
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:51,324
Now behold the awesome strength
of three blue-eyes white dragons.

60
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:56,820
Plus the mighty, the Ozan Rue.

61
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:59,800
I told you this wouldn't take long. Good.

62
00:04:00,020 --> 00:04:02,432
I must get past them and find my friends.

63
00:04:04,020 --> 00:04:09,080
I hope you realize this is just the beginning
of what my deck has in store for you.

64
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:15,640
It gets better, so please feel free
to forfeit the duel at any time.

65
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:19,720
No, I've played one
monster in defense mode.

66
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,740
Very well.

67
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:25,580
I'll place two cards face down.

68
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:29,000
Is that the best you can do, Yugi?

69
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:32,969
If that's all you've got, I
can't wait to battle you myself.

70
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:34,620
Let's end this.

71
00:04:34,740 --> 00:04:35,858
It'll be over soon.

72
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:37,440
Then our duel can begin.

73
00:04:37,820 --> 00:04:40,177
First, I must make sure
my friends are safe.

74
00:04:40,260 --> 00:04:42,142
Now let's get on with this duel.

75
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:44,640
I play Karibo in defense mode.

76
00:04:46,180 --> 00:04:48,180
Now, Rare Hunter, your move.

77
00:04:49,900 --> 00:04:51,720
I hope you've got a plan.

78
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,340
As a matter of fact, I do.

79
00:04:55,540 --> 00:04:56,757
And once we destroy them,

80
00:04:56,840 --> 00:05:00,369
we'll hand both of their Egyptian
God cards to Master Marek.

81
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,400
I drew Mirror Force.

82
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:08,100
Just the card I need for our victory.

83
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:14,480
The first thing that I'll do is
place this one trap card face down.

84
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,504
Then a monster in defense mode.

85
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:20,660
If you're trying to lay a trap,
you're wasting your time and mine.

86
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:21,957
Be careful, Kaiba.

87
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:24,080
Rare hunters can be cunning.

88
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:25,360
Relax, Yugi.

89
00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:28,460
I'm about to end this duel. Well, then?

90
00:05:28,700 --> 00:05:30,400
Stand back and observe.

91
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:35,860
Now prepare to meet a creature
like none you've seen before.

92
00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:39,840
I will sacrifice my three blue eyes.

93
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:42,260
Go, my great beasts!

94
00:05:42,620 --> 00:05:48,760
So I can summon my Egyptian god card, an
almighty creature that knows no equal!

95
00:05:55,520 --> 00:06:02,337
behold its absolute power oh no what's

96
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:06,220
that the invincible obelisk the tormentor

97
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:11,997
you're no match for my egyptian god

98
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:16,117
card now behold obelisk the tormentor's

99
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:21,700
special ability I sacrificed two more
of my monsters to increase his power.

100
00:06:25,580 --> 00:06:29,040
Now, Obelisk, destroy
all of their monsters.

101
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,920
He just wiped out our defense!

102
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:39,400
And now, my Egyptian god
card, finish them all!

103
00:06:40,300 --> 00:06:42,660
I'm really sorry to disappoint you,

104
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:46,617
but Mirror Force will reflect
Obalisk's attack right back at you.

105
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:49,780
I'm afraid that your weak
trap card won't work.

106
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,300
Now go!

107
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:03,600
Victory is ours!

108
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:05,195
You two are finished!

109
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:07,478
I appreciate your assistance, Kaiba.

110
00:07:07,620 --> 00:07:09,280
Now I can find my friends.

111
00:07:09,540 --> 00:07:10,680
And then we duel.

112
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,000
Tell me now!

113
00:07:13,380 --> 00:07:14,940
Where are my friends?

114
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:20,896
Yugi, don't walk away without
taking your prize first.

115
00:07:21,060 --> 00:07:22,760
Your locator card, catch.

116
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:26,380
I must make sure my friends are all right.

117
00:07:26,980 --> 00:07:27,840
Hold on.

118
00:07:28,140 --> 00:07:29,900
I won't duel you now, Kaiba!

119
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:32,576
Mokuba, Yugi's friends are in danger.

120
00:07:32,900 --> 00:07:35,157
Contact headquarters and tell
them to use our satellite

121
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:38,137
system to track the location
of that pathetic wannabe,

122
00:07:38,220 --> 00:07:39,050
Joey Wheeler.

123
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:41,200
I'm sure the others will be there.

124
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:42,300
Thank you, Kaiba.

125
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:45,177
I'll help you find your
little group of cronies.

126
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:46,280
Then be ready.

127
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:47,818
for our duel, Yugi.

128
00:07:49,660 --> 00:07:53,480
Our satellites should hone in
on Joey's duel disk in no time.

129
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:54,820
It worked!

130
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:57,354
Master America's about to get his wish.

131
00:07:57,980 --> 00:08:00,880
Everyone he wants, all in one place.

132
00:08:04,740 --> 00:08:07,377
I am the greatest
fisherman in all of the...

133
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:08,860
Ah, ah, ah, ah!

134
00:08:15,700 --> 00:08:17,477
What do you think you're doing?

135
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:20,057
I was just trying to catch
my lunch when suddenly

136
00:08:20,140 --> 00:08:22,677
this great beast attacked
me from out of nowhere.

137
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:25,819
This is an aquarium and you
were stealing his lunch.

138
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,717
I'm feeling sick enough as it is.

139
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,630
Now get out.

140
00:08:28,713 --> 00:08:29,835
A thousand apologies.

141
00:08:30,180 --> 00:08:32,537
I was just trying to catch my daily meal.

142
00:08:32,620 --> 00:08:34,385
Well go before you are a meal.

143
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,580
You all right?

144
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:38,480
I'll get you.

145
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:42,240
You are burning up.

146
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:44,798
But what about the Ocean World show?

147
00:08:46,100 --> 00:08:47,600
I have to be in it.

148
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:50,242
Not in the shape that you're in.

149
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:53,301
But I'm the only person
here the whales will obey.

150
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:59,073
Fear not, for I am one with the sea
and all the creatures that inhabit it.

151
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:06,377
Soon I shall reach the
center of Battle City.

152
00:09:06,460 --> 00:09:08,837
then it won't be long before the limitless

153
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:11,840
power of the pharaoh
himself belongs to me.

154
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:16,940
I sense a familiar dark energy,

155
00:09:17,260 --> 00:09:19,577
the same force that control bandit Keith,

156
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:22,897
and my ring detects another
Millennium item approaching.

157
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:25,333
I'll be sure to add it to my collection.

158
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:29,240
Soon I shall possess
all seven. Hey, Bacora!

159
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:31,860
What's up, man?

160
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,746
Here to check out some duels?

161
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:34,910
Oh, hey, guys.

162
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:38,217
So tell me, how's the
tournament progressing so far?

163
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:39,130
Great.

164
00:09:39,213 --> 00:09:40,897
I already scored four locator cards.

165
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:43,980
All I need are two more,
and I'll be in the finals.

166
00:09:44,260 --> 00:09:45,672
That's quite impressive.

167
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:46,760
And where's Yugi?

168
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,997
We've been looking all over for him.

169
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:52,357
I'll bet he's probably somewhere
kicking some serious butt.

170
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,270
Can't you see it?

171
00:09:53,353 --> 00:09:56,837
Me and Yugi in the finals battling
in the rematch of the century.

172
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:59,197
Aren't you getting ahead
of yourself there, champ?

173
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:02,457
Well, I do need to crush a
couple more duelas first.

174
00:10:02,540 --> 00:10:03,640
Hey, check it out.

175
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,620
Look, guys.

176
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,880
Isn't that Mako Tsunami?

177
00:10:08,060 --> 00:10:10,957
Yeah, he should be dueling,
not performing with Shamu.

178
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:11,870
You're right.

179
00:10:11,953 --> 00:10:12,783
Let's find him.

180
00:10:13,100 --> 00:10:15,240
Then I'll challenge him to a duel.

181
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:17,000
Finals, here I come.

182
00:10:18,220 --> 00:10:20,260
Hey, hey, wait for me!

183
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:25,511
Play your foolish games while I become
the most powerful being in the world.

184
00:10:31,420 --> 00:10:32,657
So, do you see him?

185
00:10:32,740 --> 00:10:34,077
He's the one on the whale?

186
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:34,990
Woo-hoo!

187
00:10:35,160 --> 00:10:36,180
It's showtime!

188
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,760
Man, that's a strange sight.

189
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:45,920
All right!

190
00:10:50,780 --> 00:10:52,920
Oh, my God!

191
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:56,096
Thanks for the lift!

192
00:10:57,440 --> 00:11:00,540
Even the great beasts
of the sea can be tamed!

193
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,560
Hey, Mako, over here!

194
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,160
Hi, my old friends!

195
00:11:17,620 --> 00:11:18,760
It's been a while.

196
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:21,155
Yes, since Duelist Kingdom, I believe.

197
00:11:21,340 --> 00:11:23,440
It's nice to see you, my friends.

198
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:26,597
What are you doing performing
at the aquarium, Mako?

199
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:28,397
We thought you'd be here dueling.

200
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:32,900
I am here to duel and win, but my
kinship with the sea was needed first.

201
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:35,220
Well, hop off Shamu and let's duel.

202
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,892
Are you sure about that?

203
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:41,060
Perhaps you'd be better
off just enjoying my show.

204
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:43,540
Here's your show. All right.

205
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:45,760
I have four locator cards.

206
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:48,060
Join the club, fish boy.

207
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,700
Ah, I'm impressed.

208
00:11:49,980 --> 00:11:55,060
Then we shall duel and give all these
people a show to remember. Cheerin' fans?

209
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,200
Oh, I'm in.

210
00:11:56,340 --> 00:11:57,987
Awesome, they're gonna duel!

211
00:11:58,140 --> 00:12:00,057
That's even better than the whales!

212
00:12:00,140 --> 00:12:00,970
Yeah!

213
00:12:01,140 --> 00:12:03,020
Wow, this crowd digs me.

214
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:05,360
So let's do this! Land lover.

215
00:12:05,580 --> 00:12:07,400
Put up two locator cards.

216
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:10,386
Whoever wins this goes
directly to the finals.

217
00:12:10,620 --> 00:12:13,149
Cool, taking your cards
will be a pleasure.

218
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,540
Time to duel! Yeah!

219
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:23,660
Let's go!

220
00:12:26,220 --> 00:12:28,020
Come on, Joey, feed him!

221
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:32,669
Once I unleash my mighty denizens of
the deep, you'll be all washed up, Joey.

222
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:36,038
You've got a big mouth and
a short memory, Sharkbait.

223
00:12:36,220 --> 00:12:38,097
I was the one fighting
in the Duelist Kingdom

224
00:12:38,180 --> 00:12:40,592
finals while you were swimming back home.

225
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:43,300
Now, check this out. Aw, yeah!

226
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:49,720
Is this a dance or a duel?
Here we go. It's official.

227
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,038
He's lost his mind.

228
00:12:51,380 --> 00:12:52,733
Wait till he sees this.

229
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:56,857
It's that parasite card Weevil
snuck in my deck to sabotage me.

230
00:12:56,940 --> 00:12:58,352
I forgot to take it out.

231
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:03,457
Okay, Joey, just keep that adorable game
face on and never let him see you sweat.

232
00:13:03,540 --> 00:13:04,900
Go already, Guppy.

233
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,880
Make your move or forfeit.

234
00:13:07,140 --> 00:13:08,240
Quit rushing me.

235
00:13:08,740 --> 00:13:11,799
I'll give you a chance to
back out if you're scared.

236
00:13:12,780 --> 00:13:14,680
You wish, Squidbrain!

237
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:15,920
This is a strategy!

238
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:19,660
I hope I can use this thing
to infect his monsters.

239
00:13:20,060 --> 00:13:22,160
I place my card face down.

240
00:13:25,620 --> 00:13:27,740
Well, it's about time.

241
00:13:28,460 --> 00:13:32,440
Now, I summon the mighty Flying Fish!

242
00:13:33,260 --> 00:13:35,640
Attack his face down card!

243
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:38,800
Prepare to be infected!

244
00:13:41,540 --> 00:13:42,460
Hey, wait.

245
00:13:42,740 --> 00:13:44,880
My parasite didn't work. Right.

246
00:13:45,140 --> 00:13:50,022
That's because your parasite was weaker
than my monster, allowing me to destroy it.

247
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,517
So, you mean...

248
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:53,520
You just wasted your first turn.

249
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,137
Now who's the shark face?

250
00:13:55,220 --> 00:13:56,600
This is so not good.

251
00:13:57,220 --> 00:13:58,420
Come on, Joey.

252
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:00,277
This is too embarrassing to watch.

253
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,780
Okay. Here we go again.

254
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:04,120
I'll place another card face down.

255
00:14:04,940 --> 00:14:07,120
I was just getting warmed up before.

256
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:08,517
This time it's for real.

257
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:11,777
and I got a plan that'll leave
your little goldfish high and dry.

258
00:14:11,860 --> 00:14:12,690
Really?

259
00:14:12,773 --> 00:14:15,097
Well, I'll be ready for
this so-called strategy.

260
00:14:15,180 --> 00:14:18,960
I'll place a monster face
down as well and end my turn.

261
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:20,880
Let's see your strategy.

262
00:14:21,340 --> 00:14:22,940
All right, barnacle breath.

263
00:14:23,500 --> 00:14:24,820
Watch the master!

264
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:26,680
Get on with it!

265
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:30,487
Hey, hey, hey, I'm just trying
to give this crowd a good show.

266
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:31,600
Unlike you.

267
00:14:32,220 --> 00:14:33,717
That's what I'm talking about.

268
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:38,980
I sacrifice my face-down monster in
order to summon the ferocious Garoozies!

269
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,420
Nice try.

270
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:45,280
But I activate Torrential Tribute!

271
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:53,180
I guess he's the most dramatic
opponent I've ever faced.

272
00:14:58,740 --> 00:15:02,537
Keep an eye on little Yugi's
friends, my rare hunters.

273
00:15:02,620 --> 00:15:05,340
I'll be needing all of them very shortly.

274
00:15:18,220 --> 00:15:19,540
You're in my way.

275
00:15:19,740 --> 00:15:21,269
You have something I seek.

276
00:15:22,220 --> 00:15:23,760
The Millennium Ring.

277
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:28,085
It seems you're the dark force
whose presence I've been sensing.

278
00:15:28,340 --> 00:15:31,940
Give me your Millennium Item
and you may pass by. Hmm.

279
00:15:33,540 --> 00:15:36,560
You are somewhat familiar
with the ancient ways.

280
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:38,240
Why do you want my item?

281
00:15:38,420 --> 00:15:41,400
If you must know, I'm
a collector of sorts.

282
00:15:41,700 --> 00:15:44,297
And once I possess all
seven Millennium items,

283
00:15:44,380 --> 00:15:48,500
I'll control ancient powers strong
enough to rule the entire world.

284
00:15:49,180 --> 00:15:53,960
So I will ask you once again to hand
over your Millennium rod. Interesting.

285
00:15:54,300 --> 00:15:57,712
Whoever he is, he has knowledge
of the ancient scriptures.

286
00:15:59,020 --> 00:16:02,432
Fortunately for me, this
stranger doesn't know everything.

287
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:06,577
For he who possesses the boundless
power of the pharaoh himself

288
00:16:06,660 --> 00:16:11,400
controls a magic far stronger
than the seven millennium items.

289
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:13,880
My name is Marek.

290
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:14,980
I don't care.

291
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:19,180
What if I told you I had exclusive
knowledge of certain secrets?

292
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:22,540
You can have my millennium
rod if you want.

293
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:27,697
But before I hand it over to you, you
have to do something for me in exchange.

294
00:16:27,780 --> 00:16:32,837
For I am somewhat of a collector
myself And once I possess what

295
00:16:32,920 --> 00:16:37,520
I desire The Millennium Rod will
mean absolutely nothing to me

296
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:39,640
Why should I help?

297
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:44,292
I can take your Millennium Item by
force As I've done to others in the past

298
00:16:45,100 --> 00:16:48,477
Because I know the whereabouts
of several of the Millennium

299
00:16:48,560 --> 00:16:51,657
Items Including the
Millennium Necklace worn by my

300
00:16:51,740 --> 00:16:56,057
sister Perhaps there is a way
we can work together And help

301
00:16:56,140 --> 00:16:59,800
each other to get what we want
You've made a wise choice.

302
00:17:00,140 --> 00:17:01,640
With our combined power,

303
00:17:02,460 --> 00:17:05,620
no one in the entire world
will be able to stop us!

304
00:17:06,660 --> 00:17:07,640
This duel rocks!

305
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:10,657
Mako's fish deck is destroying Wheeler.

306
00:17:10,740 --> 00:17:13,975
Flying fish, attack my
opponent's life points directly.

307
00:17:19,140 --> 00:17:20,400
Go, Joey!

308
00:17:21,340 --> 00:17:25,220
And now I'll place one card
face down and complete my turn.

309
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:27,660
Feel the power of my sea deck.

310
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:30,800
Mako Tsunami will show no mercy. Fine.

311
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:32,216
Who's asking you to?

312
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:36,140
For years, I have searched for
my lost father on the open seas.

313
00:17:36,380 --> 00:17:39,674
And I have used nothing but
a small wooden fishing boat.

314
00:17:40,580 --> 00:17:44,237
Every time I battle the mighty
ocean waters, I become stronger.

315
00:17:44,320 --> 00:17:46,477
And no matter how
difficult the struggle is,

316
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:49,736
I have vowed never to stop
searching until I find him.

317
00:17:50,460 --> 00:17:53,377
I face my dueling opponents
with the same determination,

318
00:17:53,460 --> 00:17:56,460
and I fight every duel
in honor of my father.

319
00:17:56,660 --> 00:17:59,307
I know in my heart we'll
be reunited someday.

320
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:01,020
But until that time,

321
00:18:01,220 --> 00:18:06,140
even though he's not right here, he
continues to inspire me and give me strength.

322
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:07,490
Guess what?

323
00:18:07,573 --> 00:18:10,380
I got someone who inspires
me like that also.

324
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:12,540
My little sister, Serenity.

325
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:13,996
And guess what else?

326
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:16,320
I don't show any mercy either, pal.

327
00:18:16,540 --> 00:18:18,422
Get on with the duel, my friend.

328
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:24,040
You can do it!

329
00:18:24,540 --> 00:18:26,080
Just stay calm, Joey.

330
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:27,476
All right, let's go.

331
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:31,420
I play Alligator's Sword in attack mode.

332
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:35,520
And I place two more cards face down.

333
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:37,780
Your turn, Flipper.

334
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:40,840
Perhaps I underestimated him.

335
00:18:41,120 --> 00:18:43,077
He is more determined than I thought.

336
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:44,000
Very well.

337
00:18:44,260 --> 00:18:46,177
I'll just have to teach him a lesson.

338
00:18:46,260 --> 00:18:47,217
Prepare to lose!

339
00:18:47,300 --> 00:18:52,241
The only thing I'm going to lose is my lunch
from the smell of all this rotten fish.

340
00:18:52,660 --> 00:18:57,760
I sacrificed the weaker flying fish in order
to summon the stronger amphibian beast.

341
00:18:58,940 --> 00:19:01,180
I'm not frightened of that tadpole.

342
00:19:01,420 --> 00:19:04,860
You will be when amphibian
beast attacks with sea claw.

343
00:19:07,580 --> 00:19:08,620
Hold on.

344
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:10,960
Activate fairy box.

345
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:15,180
Where did your gator disappear to?

346
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:18,997
Well, what's the matter?

347
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,557
You never played Whack-A-Crack?

348
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:22,720
That's very clever, but watch this.

349
00:19:23,040 --> 00:19:26,197
Even the mighty alligator sword
can't breathe under water.

350
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:27,740
So I play Yumi.

351
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:32,320
Raise the water level of this field
by covering it with ocean water.

352
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:35,820
My alligator's completely
submerged in water.

353
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:40,289
It's only a matter of time
before it has to come up for air.

354
00:19:41,160 --> 00:19:43,240
And that time is now. Attack!

355
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:45,480
Hold on, frog face.

356
00:19:46,260 --> 00:19:47,860
Activate Skull Dice!

357
00:19:49,300 --> 00:19:51,697
The number that I roll will determine how

358
00:19:51,780 --> 00:19:54,427
much your Toad's attack
points get decreased.

359
00:19:55,020 --> 00:19:55,850
Yes!

360
00:19:55,933 --> 00:19:57,620
They get divided by four!

361
00:19:57,980 --> 00:19:59,280
Frog Legs, anyone?

362
00:20:00,780 --> 00:20:03,400
All right, that just
about evens the score.

363
00:20:04,360 --> 00:20:06,940
You're a worthy opponent, Joey. Well done.

364
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:09,911
You're pretty worthy yourself there, Mako.

365
00:20:10,280 --> 00:20:14,517
But this duel has just begun and
the sea hides many great mysteries.

366
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:16,340
and great terrors,

367
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:21,117
the most powerful and dangerous creatures
of all lie hidden deep beneath its waters.

368
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:25,100
I will prevail and obtain my
place in the Battle City Finals,

369
00:20:25,220 --> 00:20:28,920
for I have a secret weapon
guaranteed to destroy him,

370
00:20:29,040 --> 00:20:31,640
and it waits in the
depths of my ocean deck.
